Locked camera, one continuous shot. For the first two seconds, calm water is perfectly still and no source object is visible. Then a clear water droplet falls from above and hits the center. Only after contact, a small splash appears and circular ripples expand. The background and camera remain unchanged. | one clear water droplet | a small splash and expanding circular ripples
Locked side-view camera, one continuous shot. For the first two seconds, a red ball is absent and three lavender blocks stand upright and still. Then the ball rolls in from the left and strikes the first block. Only after contact, that block tips over. The background and camera remain unchanged. | one red rubber ball | the contacted block tips over
Locked camera, one continuous shot. For the first two seconds, a thin glass square is intact and no source object is visible. Then a black steel ball falls from above and hits the glass. Only after contact, cracks spread and small fragments break away. The background and camera remain unchanged. | one black steel ball | cracks and glass fragments appear
Locked camera, one continuous shot. For the first two seconds, black sand is flat and no source object is visible. Then a blue rubber ball falls from above and hits the sand. Only after contact, grains scatter and a round crater appears. The background and camera remain unchanged. | one blue rubber ball | scattered grains and a round crater
Locked camera, one continuous shot. For the first two seconds, black sand is flat with no tracks and no car is visible. Then a yellow toy car enters and drives across the sand. Two fresh wheel tracks appear only behind the moving car. The background and camera remain unchanged. | one yellow toy car | two fresh wheel tracks
